+ * load (many worker threads, a concurrent bb_pair session, a burst of
+ * client polling) even though the device is registered fine and the
+ * exact same query succeeds moments later. Every caller (ar8030-linkctl,
+ * ar8030-pair, ar8030-status) funnels through this one function to find
